# Demo-client build-time configuration (all optional).
# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and adjust. None of these require a rebuild
# to retarget the demo at runtime — the API base URL is set in the browser
# (Settings page) and persisted to localStorage, overriding the built-in default.

# Overrides the built-in default API base URL (https://terminschleuder.online).
# The demo uses this on first run (no onboarding prompt). Set it to point a
# deploy at a different backend (e.g. staging), or to an empty string to
# restore the first-run onboarding prompt. The user can still change it at
# runtime in Settings — the image stays origin-agnostic either way.
# VITE_DEFAULT_API_URL=https://staging.terminschleuder.online

# Override the Leaflet tile layer (defaults to OpenStreetMap). Respect the OSM
# tile usage policy if you keep the default: https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/tiles/
# VITE_MAP_TILES_URL=https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png